docs/fidelity.md:100:- Player infection and passive weapons now run after the field update. New primary shots take their first field step immediately; new passive shots wait for the next field step. Massive Cannon completion now polls the authored26-frame timeline after field bullets; the new projectile has age0 until the following field update. Its timeline keeps looping while pause suspends engine polling. Upgrade choice and secondary-help dialogs remember an interrupted crossing and restore it on close instead of abandoning it in playing mode. This dialog return behavior also preserves the requested pause-during-crossing addition; remaining full-loop differences are listed above.
