docs/fidelity.md:272:- `BTAGameWorld.Run:489–541` changes gameplay polling in pause/transit without recursively stopping tank children. `_‑Rm:187–194` removes background ENTER_FRAME listeners only. Tank body/weapon poses now use independent `Tank.artAge`, advanced once for the avatar and both attached field populations on every stage step. Cached inactive fields remain detached. `Tank.age` stays with active Run; the old transit-only increment was a rendering workaround and is removed. Painting and part alpha contact consume the same retained stage pose. Exact global stage/ENTER_FRAME phase ordering still needs original-runtime comparison.
